 * Declares the FunctionSymbol class.
 * 
 * FunctionSymbol represents the semantic information associated with a function
 * declaration (`FunctionDecl`). It stores the syntactic declaration, semantic
 * attributes (override, final, unsafe, C-variadic, method status), and the
 * validated prototype and body produced during semantic analysis.
 *
 * <hr>
